{"format":1,"id":"was_mir_wichtig_ist","kurz":"ww","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Was mir wichtig ist","untertitel":"An einen eigenen Wert denken und an einen Moment, in dem du danach gehandelt hast.","haltung":["sitzen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":180},"normal":{"ziel_s":420},"lang":{"ziel_s":600}},"kb":465,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/1.7c6b4eba.mp3","ms":8433,"text":"Setz dich bequem hin. Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Du kannst jederzeit aufhören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.1,"normal":3,"lang":5.7}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/2.13722e97.mp3","ms":2944,"text":"Atme ein paarmal ruhig ein und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.1,"normal":5,"lang":9.1}}]},{"id":"wert","segmente":[{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/3.3c71c7a6.mp3","ms":4004,"text":"Denk an etwas, das dir im Leben wirklich wichtig ist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.6,"normal":4,"lang":7.4}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/4.7bfeda04.mp3","ms":4432,"text":"Zum Beispiel deine Familie, Freundschaft oder Gesundheit.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.1,"normal":3,"lang":5.7}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/5.1e7d8fda.mp3","ms":5274,"text":"Oder Ehrlichkeit, Lernen, etwas zu erschaffen oder anderen zu helfen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.6,"normal":6,"lang":10.8}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/6.eebbd352.mp3","ms":3728,"text":"Wähle den Wert, der dir heute am meisten bedeutet.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":41.5,"normal":62,"lang":65.5}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/7.03f3ea45.mp3","ms":5103,"text":"Warum ist er dir wichtig? Lass die Antwort in Ruhe kommen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":10,"lang":16}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":62,"lang":59}}]},{"id":"erinnerung","segmente":[{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/8.cb8d1875.mp3","ms":7801,"text":"Erinnere dich an einen Moment, in dem du nach diesem Wert gehandelt hast. Auch etwas Kleines zählt.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.6,"normal":6,"lang":10.8}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/9.d6a7b9e9.mp3","ms":4464,"text":"Vielleicht war es ein Gespräch, eine Hilfe oder eine Entscheidung.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":10.8}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/10.d3b79e8e.mp3","ms":3460,"text":"Wo warst du? Was hast du getan?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5.2,"normal":8,"lang":14.8}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/11.11e9efe3.mp3","ms":3059,"text":"Spür nach, wie sich das angefühlt hat.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":14.8}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/12.7130998b.mp3","ms":3305,"text":"Was sagt dieser Moment darüber, wer du bist?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":40,"normal":62,"lang":62}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/13.d3402fe9.mp3","ms":2931,"text":"Lass diesen Moment noch etwas nachklingen.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":62}}]},{"id":"schritt","segmente":[{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/14.c4274175.mp3","ms":5312,"text":"Was wäre ein kleiner Schritt, den du heute oder morgen in diesem Sinn tun kannst?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":6.2,"normal":10,"lang":18.2}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/15.55e257e2.mp3","ms":2393,"text":"Stell dir vor, wie du ihn machst.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":18.2}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/16.1e1cc217.mp3","ms":2854,"text":"Was brauchst du, damit es leichter geht?","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":10,"lang":16}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":62,"lang":59}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/17.a76e59c1.mp3","ms":4714,"text":"Deine Werte können dir Halt geben, auch wenn gerade etwas schwer ist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.6,"normal":4,"lang":7.4}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"ww/18.48b78fb6.mp3","ms":4055,"text":"Atme einmal tief ein und aus, und öffne die Augen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3.4}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}